          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA yaagira Musa ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gambira Abaisraeli ebigambo byangye ebi ndikugamba ningira nti: Ku murihika omu nsi ei ndikubatwaramu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mwarya aha by'okurya byayo, muryahongyera MUKAMA empongano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NEH.10.37"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Neh 10:37",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PRO.3.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enf 3:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Aha saano ei muribanza kusa muryahonga omugaati kuba empongano; muryagihonga kuba empongano erugire aha mbuga y'okuhuuriraho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha saano ei muribanza kusa muryaihaho empongano y'okuhongyera MUKAMA omu busingye bwanyu bwona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.4.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 4:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwonka ku murishobya, mutaarinda biragiro ebi byona, ebi MUKAMA yaaragiire Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nibyo byona ebi MUKAMA yaabaragiriire omuri Musa, okwiha aha kiro eki MUKAMA yaaragiriireho ebiragiro okuhitsya ebiro byona omu busingye bwanyu bwona, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.28.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 28:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kumuriba mutakikozire nkana, kandi kitaamanywa ihanga, eihanga ryona riryahonga enimi nto kuba ekitambo ky'okwotsya, eky'ekisooroora kirungi ekihongyeirwe MUKAMA, hamwe n'empongano y'esaano yaakyo n'empongano y'eby'okunywa byakyo, nk'emigyenzo yaabyo oku eri, kandi n'empaya y'embuzi kuba ekitambo ky'ekibi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
