        },
        {
          "text": " Omunyamurwa arihiirire eihanga ry'Abaisraeli ryona, kandi riryasaasirwa; ahabw'okuba baryaba batakikozire nkana, kandi baryaba bareetsire empongano yaabo, eyokiibwe omu muriro, ehongyeirwe MUKAMA, bareetsire n'ekitambo ky'ekibi omu maisho ga MUKAMA ahabw'ekyo kibi ki batarakozire nkana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.25",
