              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ahabw'ekyo eihanga ryona ery'Abaisraeli hamwe n'omunyaihanga oriba abashuhuukiiremu, baryasaasirwa; ahakuba eihanga ryona riryaba ritakikozire nkana.",
