              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwonka omuntu weena orikora ekibi nkana n'amaryo, yaaba nzaarwa nari omunyaihanga, ogwo muntu aryaba ajumire MUKAMA, kandi aryacuubwa omu ihanga rye. ",
